        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni kw Imana Uhoraho agize, uwaremye amajuru akayāgānura, uwagaranzuye isi n’ivy’ imera, uwahaye abantu bo muri yo guhumeka, kand’ abayigendako akabaha ubugingo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.5",
