            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni muririmbire Uhoraho indirimbo nsha, n’ishimwe ryiwe uhereye ku mpera y’isi; muririmbe yemwe abagenda ku kiyaga, n’ibiri muri co vyose, namwe biyaya vyo kuri co, n’ababibamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubugaragwa n’ibisagara vyabgo ni birangurure ijwi, n’imihana y’Abakedari; ababa i Sela baririmbe, basemerere bari ku mpinga z’imisozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo ni vyubahe Uhoraho, vyamamaze ishimwe ryiwe mu baba ku kiyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.78.65"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 78:65",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.59.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 59:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho azoja gutera nk’umuhizi, arwanane ishaka nk’intōre mu ntambara: azobīrahira, mber’ azobīvuga n’ijwi rirenga; abansi biwe azobagirira ibikomeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eh’ aho nahoreye; naracereje, ndiyumanganya: noneho ndataka cane nk’umugore ari mu bise, nzohezagirika nsēmagiritse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.50.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 50:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzotongora imisozi n’uturambi, numishe ivyatsi vyose vyaho; mu nzūzi nzohahindura i musozi, kandi nzokamya ibidengeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
